  "findings": [
    "The stable Plus parser deliberately leaves dollar-delimited math to Obsidian.",
    "The conservative Plus source mapper can reject boxed expressions because MathJax expands the wrapper before annotation.",
    "Some Chinese text runs are single MathJax text leaves, preventing per-character hit mapping in the current mapper.",
    "Repeated prefix slicing and newline splitting in list-presentation detection cause quadratic work across many indented formulas.",
    "Selection changes rebuild Plus decorations; this is not equivalent to rerendering every MathJax widget."
